WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.085
I'm lonely. I'm bored.

2
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:17.451
And I'm really sad.

3
00:00:17.452 --> 00:00:19.781
I'm stuck in my room.

4
00:00:19.782 --> 00:00:24.367
And I'm getting mad.

5
00:00:24.368 --> 00:00:30.397
My friends are playing.

6
00:00:30.398 --> 00:00:33.335
And I'm in my bed.

7
00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:38.782
I can't play outside with this broken leg!

8
00:00:38.783 --> 00:00:52.401
If I had wings, I would fly high in the sky.

9
00:00:52.402 --> 00:00:54.986
I would fly to the birds.

10
00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:59.442
I'd even say, "Hi!"

11
00:00:59.443 --> 00:01:09.316
If I had fins, I would swim deep in the sea.

12
00:01:09.317 --> 00:01:15.906
I would look for treasure.

13
00:01:15.907 --> 00:01:20.869
It would be all for me.

14
00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:31.528
If I had a horse, I would ride through the mountains.

15
00:01:31.529 --> 00:01:37.366
I would stop for water.

16
00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:43.901
I'd drink from the fountains.

17
00:01:43.902 --> 00:01:51.840
If I had a sailboat, I would sail on the water.

18
00:01:51.841 --> 00:02:03.020
I would see dolphins and whales.

19
00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:10.974
I'd even see otters.

20
00:02:10.975 --> 00:02:18.426
If I had an airplane, I would fly to faraway lands.

21
00:02:18.427 --> 00:02:22.718
I would stop in the desert.

22
00:02:22.719 --> 00:02:32.480
I'd see a huge cactus in the sand.

23
00:02:32.481 --> 00:02:35.289
But I don't have wings.

24
00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:39.069
I have none of these things.

25
00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.738
I have one broken leg.

26
00:02:41.739 --> 00:02:46.672
It's stuck in a sling.

27
00:02:46.673 --> 00:02:51.728
Wait! There's a knock at my door.

28
00:02:51.729 --> 00:03:03.618
One friend, two friends, three friends, four!

